ri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eBxxaz2GW90Q7kNvwE1tcDd&_nc_oc=Ado5OjfmGlUFDWFfid8VaE1uqRqywifqgtfxIbpLw85FENItAVInvPuUnYHPDmlXfow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMDu8xniQe6Jw2sLq22JAY1vXRMuym-SCg7FJ4f-_KyRA&oe=6AD23B01"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uF8PNIZAqZEQ7kNvwGo9EWu&_nc_oc=AdpDxjpoWG_TSVPhxqxLSI-UXFupYKsAgAHc1A_1ZhJ0KHOZEiDCcE6ygQXRtQPqcf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN-4kHkzh1Fxdsedygke9VFPRMFfi8jfpKGJL2FLqUsdA&oe=6AD22C66"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1AKt42RpCuUQ7kNvwFnfW1r&_nc_oc=AdpAxl9thmyIVm82sLCyM9RlZ2ojY5alBe0gbQA416dlu3FlxbYQQ_3jVVK9KBN6Jow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPsezRSk7PTMDMp6qYN0Vq6szhk1Ycra1EihboRYmTIUA&oe=6AD23CFA"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ysSdvGhxwYQ7kNvwGyMyQT&_nc_oc=Adp2r1SpGv1fzIIxJOaNMN8hV_HSSWEgsjqAw_2iDPOV4hZSwe6hr4ijmMWk8VgjLic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMp6lrhCSLdX24sFJhJOnClCWDezKyTzxPgv0swZOlphg&oe=6AD23ECA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UcP8-r86TLEQ7kNvwFPouU0&_nc_oc=Adr2aWji5Km2k1nZiJ7rckk8tdLabf-tuOFUCMAjtf0WMypo71-4Dz09Falmhkt2rLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMGWMlIQ71Pt-c2f4hk7J1LNpDMeAnMr90C2Q1QVE8FRg&oe=6AD239FD"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Diversion cinem